Searching for hotel in house AV vs independent AV supplier in Malaga, Spain, usually means someone who has booked a hotel for a conference or a corporate event and has to decide who provides the sound, the screens and the technician. The hotel may supply them, and an outside company can too. This page helps you decide: what to ask the hotel, when its own equipment is enough, when an independent supplier makes sense and how to compare the two quotes fairly.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) is an independent supplier, so we are not neutral, and we say so. We do not know the equipment or the prices of any particular hotel, and this guide makes no claim about them. It gives you the questions that settle the choice. Our part sits within our [event technology service](/blog/event-technology-service/), where you can see the rest of what we offer.

