## Conclusion

Hotel in house AV or an independent supplier is a decision about your event and about what the room already has. The hotel's own equipment is the easier choice for a simple meeting that fits the room, and an independent supplier makes sense when you need more, want the same setup across rooms or want a separate quote. Ask the hotel for the equipment, the technician, the price and the rules for outside suppliers in writing, and compare both quotes on the same points. We are an independent supplier, from the MICE Pack at 490 euros ex VAT. [Contact us](/contact/) with your event details, or see the rest of what we offer on our [event technology service](/blog/event-technology-service/) page.

## FAQs

### Should I use the hotel's AV or an outside supplier?

It depends on your event. The hotel's own equipment is the easier choice when your program fits what the room already has, and an outside supplier makes sense when you need more than the room offers, the same setup across several rooms or a separate quote. Ask the hotel for its equipment list, the technician and the price in writing, and compare them with an independent quote.

### Can an outside supplier work in any hotel?

That is for the hotel to say. A hotel can have rules or fees for outside companies, so ask before you book. We deliver, install and test our equipment at venues across our service area, including hotels, and we worked at a hotel convention center in Torremolinos for the PROGOLD SUMMIT 2026. Send us the hotel's rules and we tell you what we need from the venue.

### What should I ask the hotel about its AV?

What is installed in the room, who operates it and for how many hours, what it costs, whether outside suppliers are allowed and what rules apply to them: access time, loading route, power points and insurance. Ask for the answers in writing, because they settle most of the decision.

### Does an independent supplier cost more than the hotel's AV?

We do not know what any hotel charges, so we cannot say. Compare the two quotes on the same points: the equipment list, the technician's hours, setup, teardown and extras. For our side, the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) is 490 euros ex VAT for up to 120 guests, with delivery, installation and a technician for up to 6 hours.
